{"ok":true,"data":{"kind":"command","command":"brief approve","summary":"Record the human's approval of the brief, bound to its text; refused while `brief check` has blockers","effect":"write","idempotency":"replay-safe","operands":[{"name":"change","valueName":"CHANGE_ID","variadic":true,"defaultNote":"the repo's only live change","domain":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$"},"help":"The changes to approve, one answer for all, none written unless every one is approvable (default: the repo's only live change)"}],"options":[{"name":"approver","valueName":"NAME","required":true,"domain":{"pattern":"^\\p{White_Space}*([^\\p{Cc}\\p{Zl}\\p{Zp}]*[^\\p{Cc}\\p{White_Space}])\\p{White_Space}*$"},"help":"Who approved (the human, not the agent)"},{"name":"note","valueName":"TEXT","required":true,"help":"The human's own words"},{"name":"relayed-via","valueName":"NAME","domain":{"pattern":"^\\p{White_Space}*([^\\p{Cc}\\p{Zl}\\p{Zp}]*[^\\p{Cc}\\p{White_Space}])\\p{White_Space}*$"},"help":"Record the human's answer on their behalf: the tool they were asked with (`ask`, `AskUserQuestion`, `chat`); an agent role may run the call only with it"},{"name":"actor","valueName":"ACTOR_ID","defaultNote":"the CANON_ACTOR environment variable, with --relayed-via","env":"CANON_ACTOR","domain":{"pattern":"^\\p{White_Space}*([^\\p{Cc}\\p{Zl}\\p{Zp}]*[^\\p{Cc}\\p{White_Space}])\\p{White_Space}*$"},"help":"With --relayed-via, the agent's actor id (default: the CANON_ACTOR environment variable)"},{"name":"digest","repeatable":true,"domain":{"pattern":"^[^=]+=sha256:[^\u0000]*$"},"help":"With --relayed-via, the digest `canon brief show --body` showed the human, as `<change>=<sha256:digest>`, once per change; a brief whose digest differs is refused"},"repo","as"],"constraints":[{"rule":"requires","if":{"name":"actor"},"then":["relayed-via"]},{"rule":"requires","if":{"name":"digest"},"then":["relayed-via"]}],"validators":[{"arguments":["relayed-via","as"],"code":"USAGE","description":"`--relayed-via` records a human's answer on behalf of an agent: a role is declared, with `--as` or the `CANON_ROLE` variable."},{"arguments":["relayed-via"],"code":"USAGE","description":"`--relayed-via` names the tool the human was asked with as one word: no white space, parenthesis or quote (the `Approved:` line writes it as `via <tool>`)."},{"arguments":["relayed-via","actor"],"code":"USAGE","description":"A relayed approval names the agent that recorded it: `--actor`, else the `CANON_ACTOR` variable, is given and is one word."},{"arguments":["relayed-via","approver","note"],"code":"USAGE","description":"A relayed approval carries the human's own name and answer word for word: with `--relayed-via`, `--approver` and `--note` are not blank."},{"arguments":["note"],"code":"APPROVAL_INVALID","description":"The human's own words (`--note`) are one line and, written by the human without `--relayed-via`, not blank once trimmed (a blank answer under `--relayed-via` is the relayed validator's, `USAGE`; the name, `--approver`, is the domain of its own)."},{"arguments":["relayed-via","digest","change"],"code":"USAGE","description":"A relayed approval names, for every change it approves, the digest the human was shown (`--digest <change>=sha256:<digest>`, once per change) and no digest of a change it does not approve. With no change operand the repo's only live change is read, and its digest is checked then."},{"arguments":["digest"],"code":"USAGE","description":"`--digest` names a change once: two entries for the same change must carry the same digest."}],"errors":["ACTOR_DENIED","BRIEF_DENIED","BRIEF_INVALID","BRIEF_NOT_FOUND","BRIEF_REQUIRED","BRIEF_UNAVAILABLE","BRIEF_WRITE_FAILED","CHANGE_REQUIRED","CONFIG_DENIED","CONFIG_INVALID","CONFIG_REQUIRED","CONFIG_UNAVAILABLE","POLICY_APPROVAL_FAILED","RELAY_DIGEST_STALE","REPO_DENIED","REPO_INVALID","REPO_LOCK_UNAVAILABLE","REPO_UNAVAILABLE","ROLE_INVALID","SPEC_ROOT_DENIED","SPEC_ROOT_INVALID","SPEC_ROOT_UNAVAILABLE","WRITE_DENIED","WRITE_INVALID"],"outputs":[{"schemaRef":"#/schemas/BriefApproveReport","schemaVersion":"1.1","when":"one change is approved"},{"schemaRef":"#/schemas/BriefApproveManyReport","schemaVersion":"1.1","when":"several changes are approved in one answer"},{"schemaRef":"#/schemas/BatchBriefApproveReport","schemaVersion":"1.1","batch":true,"when":"--input is an array or NDJSON"}],"input":{"argumentsRef":"#/schemas/BriefApproveArguments","batch":true,"maxBytes":8388608,"maxItems":10000,"example":{"approver":"alice","note":"approved as written","operands":["add-search"]}},"examples":["canon brief approve add-search --approver alice --note \"approved as written\" --json"],"x-canon":{"roles":[]}},"meta":{"command":"schema","schemaVersion":"1.5","tool":"canon","toolVersion":"0.38.0","contract":"atip/1","contractVersion":"1.5"}}
